<title>JAPAN: TIFFE EUROYEN END WITH PARED GAINS ON MACHINE DATA.</title>
<headline>TIFFE EUROYEN END WITH PARED GAINS ON MACHINE DATA.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aug 8 settlement   prev settlement</p>
<p> TIFFE Euroyen 3M (H)     99.21		   99.19</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The key March three-month euroyen futures contract settled slightly higher on Friday, paring gains toward the close after the release of closely watched machinery orders data, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;Euroyen futures were bought initially after June machinery orders came in at minus 10.6 percent, but were sold later due to a better-than-expected forecast for July-September, which came in at plus 2.2 percent,&quot; a trust bank trader said.</p>
</text>
